1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:03,320
[Characters, places and incidents
in this production]

2
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:06,640
[are entirely fictitious.]

3
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:09,960
[Viewer discretion is advised.]

4
00:00:59,665 --> 00:01:01,680
Don't give me that look.

5
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:04,440
Since I was the one
who stayed with her all night.

6
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:08,720
Since the chairman's younger brother
has confirmed her alibi,

7
00:01:08,720 --> 00:01:10,133
we should put this matter to rest.

8
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:13,960
Do you understand
how it feels to be fooled now?

9
00:01:13,960 --> 00:01:16,480
- How did you turn out like this?
- Ran, I'm sorry.

10
00:01:16,480 --> 00:01:18,080
For you to help her this much,

11
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:19,720
how many times have you slept with her?

12
00:01:19,720 --> 00:01:21,869
Are you trying to seduce Lek?

13
00:01:21,869 --> 00:01:23,120
Aren't you two in love?

14
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:25,320
Move everything here to the wall over there.

15
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:30,600
Wasn't it all because of you
that we ended up like this?

16
00:01:37,229 --> 00:01:39,111
Were you very tired yesterday?

17
00:01:39,893 --> 00:01:40,840
Yes?

18
00:01:40,840 --> 00:01:42,346
I asked if you were tired.

19
00:01:44,160 --> 00:01:45,666
Don't get me wrong.

20
00:01:45,666 --> 00:01:48,850
I was testing whether a woman
like you has feelings.

21
00:01:48,850 --> 00:01:50,466
Do you feel tired?

22
00:01:50,466 --> 00:01:51,976
Do you feel pain?

23
00:01:51,976 --> 00:01:53,560
Do you even love someone?

24
00:01:57,115 --> 00:02:00,177
And don't even think about
playing games with Sam or Lek.

25
00:02:00,880 --> 00:02:03,640
Look at yourself. You don't deserve anyone.

26
00:02:06,160 --> 00:02:08,160
Do you have a mirror?

27
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:10,160
Or should I find one for you?

28
00:02:13,457 --> 00:02:16,177
I do, but I never look at my reflection.

29
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:19,822
No wonder you look so pathetic.

30
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:23,345
What does my appearance
have to do with my work?

31
00:02:23,345 --> 00:02:25,058
Be rational.

32
00:02:25,058 --> 00:02:26,360
Getting bold, huh?

33
00:02:27,600 --> 00:02:28,640
Oh, I forgot...

34
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:32,400
You only wanted to seduce me
back then, didn't you?

35
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:34,822
Yes.

36
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:37,933
But I don't want you anymore.

37
00:02:37,933 --> 00:02:39,065
Not even for free.

38
00:02:39,065 --> 00:02:40,111
Why?

39
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:42,422
I know exactly what you're up to.

40
00:02:43,160 --> 00:02:45,440
You're planning to seduce either Sam or Lek.

41
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:49,680
If you think that way,

42
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:50,760
then yes.

43
00:02:51,780 --> 00:02:54,533
I've been thinking about who I should seduce.

44
00:02:58,160 --> 00:02:59,960
You're into violence now?

45
00:03:00,600 --> 00:03:02,320
What are you going to do to me?

46
00:03:03,160 --> 00:03:05,120
Slap me as your fiancée did?

47
00:03:10,981 --> 00:03:12,600
You're disgusting, Daran.

48
00:03:14,720 --> 00:03:16,330
Get back to work.

49
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:25,577
Don't ask others for help,

50
00:03:25,577 --> 00:03:27,580
or I'll have you do this every day.

51
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:51,240
What did she do to deserve this?

52
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:54,844
We can't even lend her a hand
since Mr. Yai won't allow us to.

53
00:03:54,844 --> 00:03:57,700
Did Ran's father kill
Mr. Yai's father or something?

54
00:03:57,700 --> 00:04:00,200
- Is that why he holds a grudge against her?
- No.

55
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:01,520
- Oh.
- Damn.

56
00:04:01,520 --> 00:04:03,860
I'm sorry, I wasn't talking
about your father, Mr. Lek.

57
00:04:03,860 --> 00:04:05,185
I meant Mr. Yai's father.

58
00:04:05,185 --> 00:04:06,600
Boy!

59
00:04:06,600 --> 00:04:08,105
They have the same father.

60
00:04:08,105 --> 00:04:09,422
It's alright.

61
00:04:09,422 --> 00:04:12,491
My mom and dad passed away
a long time ago. It's not her doing.

62
00:04:12,491 --> 00:04:13,680
Mr. Lek...

63
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:16,360
By the way,
you're dressed particularly nicely...

64
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:17,600
Don't tease me.

65
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:19,933
I have work to attend to.

66
00:04:33,400 --> 00:04:34,520
Mr. Lek?

67
00:04:54,748 --> 00:04:58,800
Keep going. P.S. Please don't tell Yai.

68
00:05:17,970 --> 00:05:19,480
You look pathetic.

69
00:05:21,577 --> 00:05:24,911
If it's too much,
you can hand in your resignation.

70
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:28,160
Don't make this even more of an eyesore.

71
00:05:29,555 --> 00:05:30,993
I can do it.

72
00:05:32,266 --> 00:05:33,751
Up to you then.

73
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:48,761
I said, "Don't ask others for help."
And what's this?

74
00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:56,000
Someone gave that to me. It was just kindness.
They didn't help me work.

75
00:05:57,440 --> 00:05:59,160
Is there anything else?

76
00:05:59,160 --> 00:06:01,040
If that's all, let me get back to work.

77
00:06:17,380 --> 00:06:18,933
Ah!

78
00:06:18,933 --> 00:06:19,955
Ran!

79
00:06:22,488 --> 00:06:25,280
Ran! Ran! Ran!

80
00:06:25,280 --> 00:06:26,440
Ran, are you okay?!

81
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:27,480
Ran...

82
00:06:28,555 --> 00:06:29,920
Yai...

83
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:31,618
Ran...

84
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:40,160
[Accident]
[Emergency Room]

85
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:42,029
Please wait outside.

86
00:07:18,688 --> 00:07:19,844
Ran!

87
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:29,822
See, Yai?

88
00:07:29,822 --> 00:07:32,600
It's because you worked her so hard.

89
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:36,365
It was an accident. I didn't hit her head.

90
00:07:36,365 --> 00:07:40,389
Wasn't it you who forced her to work
when she was already exhausted?

91
00:07:44,733 --> 00:07:46,170
We have to talk.

92
00:07:47,133 --> 00:07:48,381
Right now.

93
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:56,678
I think you went too far.

94
00:07:57,622 --> 00:08:00,920
Ran is a woman. Did you plan to kill her?

95
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:02,720
You're being dramatic.

96
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:05,725
Maybe talk to me like this
when she actually dies.

97
00:08:05,725 --> 00:08:07,640
You're so cruel to Ran.

98
00:08:08,488 --> 00:08:09,998
What did she do to you?

99
00:08:11,400 --> 00:08:13,365
You used to love her.

100
00:08:14,133 --> 00:08:16,740
Is it hard to forgive someone you loved?

101
00:08:24,879 --> 00:08:27,088
Can you take care of the office for me?

102
00:08:28,317 --> 00:08:29,944
I'll stay and watch this woman.

103
00:08:30,834 --> 00:08:33,480
So, do you hate her, or worry about her?

104
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:34,857
I'm worried about you.

105
00:08:35,586 --> 00:08:37,964
I want you to stay away from this woman.

106
00:08:40,400 --> 00:08:42,980
I don't want you to be heartbroken like I was.

107
00:10:03,911 --> 00:10:06,444
I don't want anyone to be hurt
by you ever again.

108
00:10:10,022 --> 00:10:11,320
[2026]

109
00:10:12,225 --> 00:10:13,465
[2013]

110
00:10:13,465 --> 00:10:14,488
Ran.

111
00:10:15,520 --> 00:10:18,560
When I come back after I graduate,
let's get married.

112
00:10:19,880 --> 00:10:23,560
I'll train hard to make the national team.

113
00:10:25,111 --> 00:10:28,133
Are national athletes allowed to get married?

114
00:10:29,666 --> 00:10:31,244
I don't know.

115
00:10:31,244 --> 00:10:33,640
But we have to focus on our future first, Yai.

116
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:38,800
Okay then. I agree.

117
00:10:40,280 --> 00:10:41,680
I'll wait for you, Ran.

118
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:44,998
I'll wait for you too, Yai.

119
00:10:54,928 --> 00:10:56,368
Oh, that's perfect.

120
00:10:57,120 --> 00:10:59,960
Wow, it fits you perfectly.

121
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:01,920
My grandson.

122
00:11:01,920 --> 00:11:06,040
You were just a little kid, but now
you're grown up and about to study abroad.

123
00:11:06,920 --> 00:11:09,140
You're leaving for France tonight, Grandma?

124
00:11:09,140 --> 00:11:11,440
I won't be back in time to see you off.

125
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:15,926
But next month, I'll fly over to visit you
and stay with you for a week. Okay?

126
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:20,160
- Can't you stay for a month, Grandma?
- Don't be so clingy now.

127
00:11:20,160 --> 00:11:24,120
Maybe I'll stay there for three years, then
we'll come home together after you graduate.

128
00:11:24,120 --> 00:11:25,555
That's even better.

129
00:11:25,555 --> 00:11:28,238
Don't get into any trouble over there.

130
00:11:28,238 --> 00:11:30,400
Remember to focus on studying.

131
00:11:30,400 --> 00:11:31,800
Yes.

132
00:11:31,800 --> 00:11:33,160
Excuse me, ma'am,

133
00:11:33,160 --> 00:11:35,199
- Yai's phone is ringing.
- Yes.

134
00:11:38,600 --> 00:11:40,086
I'll be back.

135
00:11:42,800 --> 00:11:45,000
What was the caller's name?

136
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:46,880
It said Daran.

137
00:11:50,761 --> 00:11:54,400
Ran. What's wrong?
Why can't we talk over the phone?

138
00:11:57,280 --> 00:11:58,440
Ran?

139
00:12:01,751 --> 00:12:02,955
Yai...

140
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:05,937
I'm pregnant...

141
00:12:08,703 --> 00:12:11,480
What should we do, Yai?

142
00:12:11,480 --> 00:12:13,680
What should we do?

143
00:12:21,267 --> 00:12:23,911
What should we do...

144
00:12:29,088 --> 00:12:31,511
Ran, did you check properly?

145
00:12:31,511 --> 00:12:34,000
I don't want to disappoint Mom and Dad.

146
00:12:35,186 --> 00:12:37,392
They trusted me.

147
00:12:38,561 --> 00:12:40,560
We'll figure something out.

148
00:12:40,560 --> 00:12:41,740
How?

149
00:12:43,044 --> 00:12:44,291
Listen to me.

150
00:12:44,920 --> 00:12:47,560
You have to try out for
the national team next month.

151
00:12:47,560 --> 00:12:50,660
And a month after that,
you have to start university.

152
00:12:50,660 --> 00:12:54,280
I won't let your future end right here.

153
00:12:54,280 --> 00:12:58,240
I'm sorry that I made you go through this.

154
00:12:59,577 --> 00:13:03,040
I'm sorry for not stopping myself

155
00:13:03,040 --> 00:13:04,880
even though you suggested we stop.

156
00:13:07,218 --> 00:13:08,754
I'm also at fault...

157
00:13:09,373 --> 00:13:11,140
I couldn't bring myself to stop,

158
00:13:12,295 --> 00:13:14,037
because I love you, Yai...

159
00:13:15,080 --> 00:13:16,998
Can you do as I say?

160
00:13:41,271 --> 00:13:44,400
Ms. Daran, this way, please.

161
00:13:58,120 --> 00:14:00,160
[Examination Room]

162
00:14:02,870 --> 00:14:06,444
Yai, is this really the right thing to do?

163
00:14:10,688 --> 00:14:12,336
Only the patient can enter.

164
00:14:21,200 --> 00:14:24,111
So? Will you do it?

165
00:14:24,111 --> 00:14:26,080
Yai, I'm scared.

166
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:35,080
You don't have to do this. Not anymore.

167
00:14:38,888 --> 00:14:41,070
[Welcome]

168
00:14:43,720 --> 00:14:45,440
[Obstetrics and Gynecology Clinic]

169
00:14:51,244 --> 00:14:53,844
I can go back to study later.

170
00:14:53,844 --> 00:14:56,120
But how will I tell Mom and Dad about this?

171
00:14:56,920 --> 00:14:58,480
What about you, Yai?

172
00:14:59,240 --> 00:15:02,070
You're flying to study abroad next month.

173
00:15:02,070 --> 00:15:05,311
It's fine. There are plenty
of universities in Thailand.

174
00:15:07,133 --> 00:15:08,355
But will you...

175
00:15:09,160 --> 00:15:10,554
be alright, Ran?

176
00:15:14,022 --> 00:15:16,120
Dad will be heartbroken.

177
00:15:18,066 --> 00:15:20,797
I won't be able to make
the national team this year.

178
00:15:22,977 --> 00:15:24,022
Or...

179
00:15:27,040 --> 00:15:29,020
should I get an abortion?

180
00:15:29,020 --> 00:15:30,111
No,

181
00:15:30,733 --> 00:15:32,172
the baby should live.

182
00:15:34,733 --> 00:15:36,179
Where are you going, Yai?

183
00:15:43,101 --> 00:15:46,080
Dad... Mom...

184
00:15:46,080 --> 00:15:47,920
I'm sorry.

185
00:16:19,677 --> 00:16:20,826
Dear...

186
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:27,456
I can't believe it...

187
00:16:30,842 --> 00:16:33,279
I never thought she would do this.

188
00:16:37,680 --> 00:16:39,859
Why didn't she think this through?

189
00:16:43,240 --> 00:16:44,552
I'm angry.

190
00:16:46,533 --> 00:16:49,029
Angry that she destroyed her own future.

191
00:16:51,333 --> 00:16:52,521
Dear,

192
00:16:54,040 --> 00:16:58,888
Ran chose to take responsibility
for what she did without thinking it through.

193
00:16:58,888 --> 00:17:00,890
She's very brave, dear.

194
00:17:03,240 --> 00:17:07,200
It has already happened.
We can't run from the truth.

195
00:17:07,888 --> 00:17:10,560
We can only try to find
the best way to resolve this.

196
00:17:12,622 --> 00:17:13,740
Dear,

197
00:17:15,690 --> 00:17:18,820
aren't you upset at all?

198
00:17:18,820 --> 00:17:20,360
Of course I am.

199
00:17:21,120 --> 00:17:26,600
If something bad happened to your child,
any mother would be heartbroken.

200
00:17:29,163 --> 00:17:33,560
But I won't take out my disappointment
and sadness on my child.

201
00:17:35,520 --> 00:17:39,499
When our child makes a mistake
and needs help...

202
00:17:39,499 --> 00:17:43,880
If we're not on their side, then who will?

203
00:17:46,690 --> 00:17:49,243
Dear, would you agree if I said,

204
00:17:49,243 --> 00:17:52,520
"There's nobody in this world
who wants to make a mistake"?

205
00:17:55,038 --> 00:17:57,200
That includes those two.

206
00:17:58,930 --> 00:18:03,755
If they make a mistake, we should teach them
right from wrong rather than berate them.

207
00:18:07,400 --> 00:18:08,671
Thanks, dear.

208
00:18:09,680 --> 00:18:12,562
Thank you for reminding me.

209
00:18:22,622 --> 00:18:24,145
You don't have to feel bad

210
00:18:24,800 --> 00:18:26,800
for not fulfilling my dream.

211
00:18:27,380 --> 00:18:30,866
Right now,
take good care of yourself and the baby.

212
00:18:35,773 --> 00:18:37,973
Thank you so much, Mom, Dad.

213
00:18:41,545 --> 00:18:43,059
I promise

214
00:18:43,817 --> 00:18:45,840
I'll be more careful from now on.

215
00:18:50,511 --> 00:18:51,622
What about you?

216
00:18:52,989 --> 00:18:54,840
Does your family know?

217
00:18:54,840 --> 00:18:56,786
I wanted to talk to you two first.

218
00:18:57,355 --> 00:18:58,989
How are you going to tell them

219
00:18:59,760 --> 00:19:01,440
that you have a wife and child?

220
00:19:02,080 --> 00:19:04,933
May I register our marriage first?

221
00:19:04,933 --> 00:19:06,800
If you'll allow me.

222
00:19:06,800 --> 00:19:08,134
Yai...

223
00:19:09,955 --> 00:19:12,760
Wait, wait, let's not be hasty.

224
00:19:12,760 --> 00:19:15,400
We can take it slow.

225
00:19:15,400 --> 00:19:18,120
In short, our family knows about this.

226
00:19:18,120 --> 00:19:20,577
But your parents need to know too.

227
00:19:20,577 --> 00:19:22,866
Go tell them about this

228
00:19:22,866 --> 00:19:24,955
so that we can arrange a meeting.

229
00:19:24,955 --> 00:19:27,622
My grandma will be back
by the end of next month.

230
00:19:28,666 --> 00:19:30,177
Right now, there's only Mom.

231
00:19:30,960 --> 00:19:32,040
We can wait.

232
00:19:33,200 --> 00:19:35,091
Once everyone is here,

233
00:19:35,091 --> 00:19:36,761
we can settle everything in one go.

234
00:19:41,332 --> 00:19:42,511
And Ran,

235
00:19:44,488 --> 00:19:46,949
you need to take good care of yourself.

236
00:19:46,949 --> 00:19:48,133
No more training.

237
00:19:48,720 --> 00:19:52,600
You don't have to prepare for nationals.
And no more taekwondo.

238
00:19:52,600 --> 00:19:55,133
I'll have to leave for work in Chiang Mai,

239
00:19:55,133 --> 00:19:56,760
so don't make me worry.

240
00:19:58,644 --> 00:20:00,066
Yes, Dad.

241
00:20:13,466 --> 00:20:15,985
Yai! Are you crazy?

242
00:20:15,985 --> 00:20:17,240
Are you crazy?

243
00:20:17,240 --> 00:20:18,911
Why won't you study abroad?

244
00:20:18,911 --> 00:20:21,367
You'll have to manage thousands of people!

245
00:20:21,367 --> 00:20:25,680
If you only graduate from here,
how can your employees have faith in you?

246
00:20:25,680 --> 00:20:28,680
There are many other ways
to earn people's respect.

247
00:20:28,680 --> 00:20:30,777
Is it because you fell for a woman?

248
00:20:30,777 --> 00:20:31,800
Who is she?

249
00:20:32,760 --> 00:20:34,888
Stop this right now, Yai.

250
00:20:34,888 --> 00:20:38,840
I raised you and gave you a good life,

251
00:20:38,840 --> 00:20:43,280
not for you to fall for a woman
and throw your future away like this.

252
00:20:43,280 --> 00:20:45,160
I devoted my life to you.

253
00:20:45,920 --> 00:20:47,760
You can't do this.

254
00:20:47,760 --> 00:20:51,385
You should know
that every investment carries a risk.

255
00:20:51,385 --> 00:20:53,025
Stop expecting so much from me.

256
00:20:53,025 --> 00:20:55,120
Why can't I?

257
00:20:55,120 --> 00:20:57,533
You're my only son.

258
00:20:57,533 --> 00:20:59,680
Do you want people laughing at me?

259
00:20:59,680 --> 00:21:02,320
Especially your grandma, right?

260
00:21:02,320 --> 00:21:04,120
I got her pregnant.

261
00:21:04,120 --> 00:21:07,037
I'm going to have a child.
You're going to have a grandchild.

262
00:21:07,814 --> 00:21:09,200
Yai!

263
00:21:09,200 --> 00:21:12,280
Are you stupid? Are you out of your mind?

264
00:21:12,280 --> 00:21:15,040
Why did you let that woman seduce you?

265
00:21:15,040 --> 00:21:16,460
Who is she?

266
00:21:18,880 --> 00:21:23,256
Is it that damn scholarship student?

267
00:21:23,256 --> 00:21:24,567
Is it?

268
00:21:25,360 --> 00:21:27,100
- It's Daran, right?
- Yes!

269
00:21:29,480 --> 00:21:31,493
Yai...

270
00:21:31,493 --> 00:21:33,210
You've lost your mind!

271
00:21:33,840 --> 00:21:37,120
Who are her parents? What do they do?

272
00:21:37,120 --> 00:21:39,120
Tell me! What do they do?

273
00:21:39,120 --> 00:21:42,420
Her dad teaches taekwondo!
Her mom sells soy milk!

274
00:21:42,420 --> 00:21:44,880
Why did you stoop this low, Yai?

275
00:21:44,880 --> 00:21:47,000
How could you marry a worthless woman like her?

276
00:21:47,000 --> 00:21:48,511
Ran isn't worthless!

277
00:21:48,511 --> 00:21:51,888
Her parents' occupations
have nothing to do with her worth!

278
00:21:51,888 --> 00:21:54,202
Because she's worthless.

279
00:21:54,202 --> 00:21:57,065
That's why her parents told her to seduce you!

280
00:21:57,065 --> 00:21:58,720
She's so young!

281
00:21:58,720 --> 00:22:01,040
How could a slut
who got pregnant be worthy of you?!

282
00:22:01,040 --> 00:22:02,600
You're exaggerating!

283
00:22:02,600 --> 00:22:03,985
How am I exaggerating?

284
00:22:03,985 --> 00:22:07,577
What I'm saying is the truth!
Why? Can't you accept it?

285
00:22:07,577 --> 00:22:09,400
Dad got you pregnant

286
00:22:09,400 --> 00:22:11,333
and took you to Grandma.

287
00:22:11,333 --> 00:22:13,311
You're not from a wealthy family either!

288
00:22:13,311 --> 00:22:14,640
Yai!

289
00:22:15,866 --> 00:22:17,620
Dad took responsibility for you.

290
00:22:17,620 --> 00:22:19,670
So, I have to take responsibility for Ran.

291
00:22:19,670 --> 00:22:22,488
Everything that happened wasn't her fault.

292
00:22:23,800 --> 00:22:25,360
You can't do that.

293
00:22:26,120 --> 00:22:27,819
I won't let you.

294
00:22:29,000 --> 00:22:30,826
Tell her to get rid of the baby.

295
00:22:37,533 --> 00:22:39,711
How can you be so cruel, Mom?

296
00:22:40,422 --> 00:22:42,680
Don't look at me like that, Yai.

297
00:22:45,533 --> 00:22:47,155
Get rid of it!

298
00:22:47,934 --> 00:22:49,920
How much does she want? Huh?

299
00:22:52,560 --> 00:22:54,444
How much money does she need?

300
00:22:56,333 --> 00:22:57,720
Is 100,000 baht enough?

301
00:22:58,511 --> 00:22:59,644
Is it?

302
00:23:01,140 --> 00:23:03,200
We already registered our marriage.

303
00:23:07,866 --> 00:23:09,280
You idiot!

304
00:23:10,200 --> 00:23:12,888
Have you lost your mind?

305
00:23:12,888 --> 00:23:14,880
Why did you let her seduce you?

306
00:23:14,880 --> 00:23:18,044
You idiot! You're a goddamn idiot!

307
00:23:18,044 --> 00:23:19,444
Why did you have to destroy me?

308
00:23:19,444 --> 00:23:21,933
Why do you have to destroy my whole world?

309
00:23:21,933 --> 00:23:24,200
Get out! Get the hell out of here!

310
00:23:24,200 --> 00:23:27,145
Get out! Don't take anything with you.

311
00:23:27,145 --> 00:23:29,545
Not even a single baht.

312
00:23:30,177 --> 00:23:33,240
I'll wait and see. If you have nothing,

313
00:23:33,240 --> 00:23:35,600
will she still think of you as her husband?!

314
00:23:37,893 --> 00:23:38,960
Go!

315
00:23:39,600 --> 00:23:43,160
I'll give you a month.
Don't you come crawling back here.

316
00:23:44,680 --> 00:23:47,240
Bastard. You bastard!

317
00:24:03,320 --> 00:24:06,880
Yai! You bastard!

318
00:24:06,880 --> 00:24:08,880
Don't you dare crawl back here!

319
00:25:03,200 --> 00:25:06,150
We build our family from the ground up as well.

320
00:25:06,150 --> 00:25:07,244
Don't worry.

321
00:25:09,762 --> 00:25:11,755
If Grandma had been home,

322
00:25:11,755 --> 00:25:13,577
things might not have turned out like this.

323
00:25:14,666 --> 00:25:16,310
Listen.

324
00:25:16,310 --> 00:25:19,044
The first lesson in your love life

325
00:25:19,044 --> 00:25:21,920
is that you are going to be
the head of your family.

326
00:25:21,920 --> 00:25:24,311
You have to take responsibility for yourself.

327
00:25:24,311 --> 00:25:27,155
You can't rely on others all the time.

328
00:25:27,155 --> 00:25:29,730
Yes. I'll keep that in mind.

329
00:25:31,800 --> 00:25:35,490
Oh! Let's eat. Look at Danai. Yum!

330
00:25:35,490 --> 00:25:37,880
Wow, that's a big mouthful.

331
00:25:37,880 --> 00:25:39,860
Great job.

332
00:25:39,860 --> 00:25:42,640
Eat more, eat, eat.

333
00:25:43,280 --> 00:25:46,560
Eat lots and lots, Ran. Don't stress too much.

334
00:25:46,560 --> 00:25:48,200
I'll find a job

335
00:25:48,200 --> 00:25:50,080
so I can take care of you and our child.

336
00:25:51,140 --> 00:25:52,400
I can do it.

337
00:25:52,400 --> 00:25:54,200
I know you can do it.

338
00:26:02,600 --> 00:26:05,920
[Marriage Certificate]

339
00:26:07,200 --> 00:26:09,520
We're legally husband and wife now.

340
00:26:58,889 --> 00:27:01,480
Right now, I have nothing.

341
00:27:01,480 --> 00:27:03,240
Will it be okay...

342
00:27:03,920 --> 00:27:05,782
if I can't keep my promise just yet?

343
00:27:08,880 --> 00:27:11,660
As long as you're by my side,

344
00:27:11,660 --> 00:27:13,400
I don't wish

345
00:27:13,400 --> 00:27:14,959
for anything else.

346
00:27:25,577 --> 00:27:27,533
Hang in there.

347
00:27:27,533 --> 00:27:31,333
I'll make sure you and our child
can live comfortably and happily.

348
00:27:41,444 --> 00:27:44,280
So warm... When I'm with you,

349
00:27:45,400 --> 00:27:46,880
I'm not afraid of anything.

350
00:27:47,650 --> 00:27:49,890
Because I know you can protect me.

351
00:27:51,330 --> 00:27:52,693
Me too.

352
00:27:53,400 --> 00:27:55,680
As long as you stay with me,

353
00:27:56,377 --> 00:27:57,840
whatever I have to face,

354
00:27:58,511 --> 00:27:59,912
I'll go down fighting.

355
00:28:01,724 --> 00:28:04,034
But if you die, I'd be a widow.

356
00:28:04,866 --> 00:28:06,955
It would be easy to find a new boyfriend.

357
00:28:09,422 --> 00:28:12,000
Don't you dare. I'll come back to haunt you.

358
00:28:12,800 --> 00:28:14,153
I'm not scared.

359
00:28:15,111 --> 00:28:16,933
Think you're tough?

360
00:28:16,933 --> 00:28:18,288
Very.

361
00:28:18,288 --> 00:28:19,711
I like someone tough.

362
00:28:19,711 --> 00:28:21,600
Seeing you like this...

363
00:28:21,600 --> 00:28:22,918
I can't resist it.

364
00:28:32,325 --> 00:28:33,910
Yai!

365
00:28:33,910 --> 00:28:36,107
You're on my stomach.
The baby is going to be flat.

366
00:28:36,107 --> 00:28:37,329
Oh!

367
00:28:38,020 --> 00:28:39,177
I'm sorry!

368
00:28:50,448 --> 00:28:51,803
I love you so much, Ran.

369
00:28:52,670 --> 00:28:54,347
I love our child so much too.

370
00:28:55,722 --> 00:28:57,344
We'll get through this together.

371
00:28:59,889 --> 00:29:01,973
We'll be together forever.

372
00:29:02,800 --> 00:29:03,911
As father,

373
00:29:04,533 --> 00:29:06,080
mother,

374
00:29:06,080 --> 00:29:07,125
and child.

375
00:29:21,155 --> 00:29:22,377
Thank you.

376
00:29:47,586 --> 00:29:49,586
- Let me help.
- Thank you, Yai.

377
00:29:52,333 --> 00:29:53,911
Study well, Danai.

378
00:29:53,911 --> 00:29:55,120
Okay, Yai.

379
00:29:55,120 --> 00:29:56,320
Oh!

380
00:29:56,320 --> 00:29:58,265
You have to call him "Brother."

381
00:29:58,265 --> 00:30:00,050
Okay, Brother.

382
00:30:00,050 --> 00:30:02,644
- Yeah.
- Very good.

383
00:30:02,644 --> 00:30:03,866
Ran.

384
00:30:03,866 --> 00:30:07,160
I got a job at the shop by the market.
I'll be home tonight.

385
00:30:07,160 --> 00:30:08,360
Can you do that?

386
00:30:08,360 --> 00:30:10,844
Of course. He's going to pay me 300 baht.

387
00:30:10,844 --> 00:30:12,920
I should put these away now, or I'll be late.

388
00:30:14,160 --> 00:30:15,400
Bye-bye.

389
00:30:17,415 --> 00:30:18,780
Don't worry about him.

390
00:30:18,780 --> 00:30:21,665
He's still young and strong.
He can do so much more.

391
00:30:21,665 --> 00:30:23,920
You should take him to school now. Let's go.

392
00:30:23,920 --> 00:30:28,200
Why are you taking me to school?
What about Mom?

393
00:30:28,200 --> 00:30:32,320
- I'm free.
- Why aren't you going to school?

394
00:30:32,320 --> 00:30:34,622
I'm having a baby...

395
00:30:34,622 --> 00:30:35,560
in here.

396
00:30:35,560 --> 00:30:37,290
How will the baby get out?

397
00:30:38,160 --> 00:30:40,800
Stop! Let the teacher teach you about that,

398
00:30:40,800 --> 00:30:41,920
- okay?
- Okay.

399
00:30:42,622 --> 00:30:43,666
Come on.

400
00:30:45,244 --> 00:30:46,244
Let's go.

401
00:31:06,866 --> 00:31:08,122
Here.

402
00:31:14,777 --> 00:31:16,140
Hey, boy.

403
00:31:16,140 --> 00:31:18,480
- My workers aren't back yet.
- Yes?

404
00:31:18,480 --> 00:31:20,866
- Wash the dishes for me, okay?
- Yes.

405
00:31:20,866 --> 00:31:22,153
Yeah, thanks.

406
00:31:45,355 --> 00:31:47,244
This is my salary.

407
00:31:47,244 --> 00:31:48,360
It's all yours.

408
00:31:50,377 --> 00:31:52,164
Don't you want to keep some for yourself?

409
00:31:52,977 --> 00:31:54,530
What would I use it for?

410
00:31:54,530 --> 00:31:56,266
I eat breakfast and dinner here,

411
00:31:56,266 --> 00:31:58,240
and Duean packs my lunch.

412
00:32:04,178 --> 00:32:06,280
I feel so bad for you, Yai,

413
00:32:06,280 --> 00:32:08,191
that you have to struggle with me.

414
00:32:10,422 --> 00:32:11,962
Are you tired, Yai?

415
00:32:22,400 --> 00:32:24,272
You must be exhausted.

416
00:32:47,911 --> 00:32:49,598
Not anymore.

417
00:32:51,160 --> 00:32:52,360
Thank you.

418
00:33:32,715 --> 00:33:35,222
Hello, who would you like to speak to?

419
00:33:35,830 --> 00:33:37,320
Daran.

420
00:33:37,320 --> 00:33:38,840
Ran isn't home.

421
00:33:39,960 --> 00:33:41,880
Oh! Just in time.

422
00:33:41,880 --> 00:33:43,800
Ran, there's a call for you.

423
00:33:43,800 --> 00:33:45,040
Please wait a second.

424
00:33:46,466 --> 00:33:48,160
- A call.
- Okay.

425
00:33:51,318 --> 00:33:53,873
Hello, this is Daran.

426
00:33:54,945 --> 00:33:56,705
I am Yai's mother.

427
00:34:10,025 --> 00:34:11,806
I called you here

428
00:34:13,196 --> 00:34:15,210
not to criticize you.

429
00:34:16,600 --> 00:34:17,644
Yes.

430
00:34:18,369 --> 00:34:19,769
I just want to know

431
00:34:20,466 --> 00:34:22,320
how you and Yai

432
00:34:23,466 --> 00:34:25,188
will afford to raise the child.

433
00:34:26,688 --> 00:34:28,840
Forget about a bachelor's degree.

434
00:34:30,232 --> 00:34:33,077
I just fired someone
with a master's degree yesterday.

435
00:34:34,000 --> 00:34:36,720
This world is not as beautiful as you think.

436
00:34:38,466 --> 00:34:41,600
The business of Yai's family
is still doing fine, though.

437
00:34:44,311 --> 00:34:47,600
You finally said what you truly want.

438
00:34:47,600 --> 00:34:49,711
You got yourself pregnant

439
00:34:49,711 --> 00:34:51,600
so you could get rich the easy way.

440
00:34:52,866 --> 00:34:54,933
You misunderstood me, ma'am.

441
00:34:55,800 --> 00:34:59,266
Yai is my only son,

442
00:34:59,266 --> 00:35:01,355
and there's only one person

443
00:35:01,355 --> 00:35:03,360
who can be my daughter-in-law,

444
00:35:03,360 --> 00:35:04,852
and that's Nana,

445
00:35:06,160 --> 00:35:08,581
because she has the same social status

446
00:35:08,581 --> 00:35:10,861
and standing as Yai,

447
00:35:12,577 --> 00:35:18,225
not a soy milk vendor's daughter like you.

448
00:35:24,040 --> 00:35:25,399
We love each other.

449
00:35:27,400 --> 00:35:29,338
I didn't want to get rich the easy way.

450
00:35:30,080 --> 00:35:31,611
You're selfish!

451
00:35:33,160 --> 00:35:34,240
What...?

452
00:35:34,937 --> 00:35:36,330
Do you really love Yai?

453
00:35:37,240 --> 00:35:38,755
Yes.

454
00:35:38,755 --> 00:35:40,160
If you really love him,

455
00:35:40,960 --> 00:35:45,484
then why would you let him work so hard
and do manual labor because of you?!

456
00:35:47,240 --> 00:35:49,888
You know what? When Yai was born,

457
00:35:49,888 --> 00:35:53,400
I dedicated everything in my life

458
00:35:54,791 --> 00:35:56,564
to my son,

459
00:35:57,588 --> 00:36:00,160
because I wanted him to be happy

460
00:36:00,160 --> 00:36:02,377
and have a good future.

461
00:36:02,377 --> 00:36:04,888
He's all I have in my life.

462
00:36:05,800 --> 00:36:07,206
Since that day

463
00:36:08,232 --> 00:36:10,557
you decided to come into his life,

464
00:36:11,403 --> 00:36:13,960
you have ruined everything.

465
00:36:13,960 --> 00:36:15,800
Every single thing.

466
00:36:16,762 --> 00:36:18,887
You got Yai,

467
00:36:18,887 --> 00:36:20,598
but what does he have now?

468
00:36:21,666 --> 00:36:23,220
Is this what you called love?

469
00:37:08,480 --> 00:37:11,111
- Is the ice cream good?
- It is.

470
00:37:11,111 --> 00:37:12,977
I'll buy you more later, okay?

471
00:37:12,977 --> 00:37:14,040
Okay!

472
00:37:15,040 --> 00:37:16,280
Can I have some?

473
00:37:20,044 --> 00:37:22,866
Where have you been? Why didn't you tell Duean?

474
00:37:23,444 --> 00:37:25,320
I was so worried about you.

475
00:37:25,320 --> 00:37:27,280
I had nothing to do at home,

476
00:37:27,280 --> 00:37:29,888
and I got bored, so I went out.

477
00:37:29,888 --> 00:37:33,777
Then... how about
we go out together when I'm free?

478
00:37:33,777 --> 00:37:35,320
It's fine.

479
00:37:35,320 --> 00:37:36,866
It'd be a waste of money.

480
00:37:36,866 --> 00:37:39,066
I'm tired. I want to get inside for now.

481
00:38:45,950 --> 00:38:49,560
Yai! What happened? Why did you just come back?

482
00:38:49,560 --> 00:38:50,840
Nothing.

483
00:38:52,342 --> 00:38:54,200
I need to talk to you about something.

484
00:38:54,200 --> 00:38:56,422
Let me shower first, then.

485
00:38:56,422 --> 00:38:57,733
I'll hurry up.

486
00:39:09,234 --> 00:39:11,656
Is this what you call nothing, Yai?

487
00:39:19,998 --> 00:39:21,682
Ran...

488
00:39:21,682 --> 00:39:22,877
I'm sorry.

489
00:39:25,400 --> 00:39:28,066
Don't cry. I'm fine.

490
00:39:28,066 --> 00:39:30,300
How can you be fine?

491
00:39:30,300 --> 00:39:32,240
You got hurt this badly.

492
00:39:33,066 --> 00:39:35,320
Why didn't you just tell me?

493
00:39:35,320 --> 00:39:37,640
Is it because of me?

494
00:39:37,640 --> 00:39:39,120
This is nothing, Ran.

495
00:39:39,120 --> 00:39:42,440
I'm a man.
I've had worse falls playing basketball.

496
00:39:42,440 --> 00:39:44,645
But I don't want it to be like this.

497
00:39:44,645 --> 00:39:47,824
I don't want you to
go through this to take care of me.

498
00:39:49,240 --> 00:39:51,360
If you continue your education,

499
00:39:51,360 --> 00:39:52,880
I wouldn't say a thing.

500
00:39:58,044 --> 00:39:59,787
Don't think that way.

501
00:40:09,688 --> 00:40:10,928
How is it?

502
00:40:11,577 --> 00:40:14,360
How are my son and that girl doing?

503
00:40:14,360 --> 00:40:15,670
Did you see them?

504
00:40:17,200 --> 00:40:19,866
The shop owner
took the money and agreed to the plan.

505
00:40:19,866 --> 00:40:22,333
But he said Mr. Yai isn't working today

506
00:40:22,333 --> 00:40:24,888
because he got hit by a motorcycle yesterday.

507
00:40:27,822 --> 00:40:29,264
What did you say?

508
00:40:39,622 --> 00:40:40,977
You crazy bitch!

509
00:40:40,977 --> 00:40:43,688
How could you do that to Yai?

510
00:40:49,640 --> 00:40:53,800
It's all because of you.
Yai got hurt because of you!

511
00:40:53,800 --> 00:40:58,080
If anything happens to my son,
you and your child are dead!

512
00:40:58,080 --> 00:41:01,160
I'll do it! Do you hear me? I mean it!

513
00:41:05,022 --> 00:41:06,688
I'm sorry.

514
00:41:06,688 --> 00:41:09,280
I didn't want to ruin Yai's life...

515
00:41:10,080 --> 00:41:12,080
That's what you're doing right now!

516
00:41:12,080 --> 00:41:14,355
I'll give you a final warning.

517
00:41:14,355 --> 00:41:15,600
If you love Yai,

518
00:41:15,600 --> 00:41:18,760
don't drag him down
into a miserable life with you!

519
00:41:18,760 --> 00:41:20,133
Don't make my son

520
00:41:20,133 --> 00:41:22,600
end up dying in your filthy house!

521
00:41:26,133 --> 00:41:29,240
Do whatever it takes to make him come home!

522
00:41:29,240 --> 00:41:31,960
He has one more week
before he goes abroad to study.

523
00:41:31,960 --> 00:41:33,177
Don't let him...

524
00:41:34,440 --> 00:41:35,960
get stuck where you are.

525
00:41:36,600 --> 00:41:38,731
Let him have his future!!

526
00:41:44,444 --> 00:41:45,709
Get rid of the child.

527
00:41:49,320 --> 00:41:50,680
If you don't do it,

528
00:41:51,777 --> 00:41:53,622
I'll take that as a challenge.

529
00:41:55,040 --> 00:41:59,133
And I'll do way worse things to your family.

530
00:42:00,733 --> 00:42:02,138
Remember that.

531
00:43:05,600 --> 00:43:08,555
Oh, Ran. Are you back?

532
00:43:08,555 --> 00:43:11,333
Yai went outside and just got home.

533
00:43:18,200 --> 00:43:19,688
Ran.

534
00:43:19,688 --> 00:43:21,480
Ran, I have something to show you.

535
00:43:22,781 --> 00:43:24,080
I'm tired.

536
00:43:24,080 --> 00:43:26,667
It's hot. I want to take a shower.

537
00:43:27,800 --> 00:43:29,128
It won't take long.

538
00:43:30,240 --> 00:43:32,320
You should take a shower, too.

539
00:43:32,320 --> 00:43:34,680
You're sweaty and filthy right now.

540
00:43:45,760 --> 00:43:49,171
Don't be angry at her.
Pregnant women are like this.

541
00:43:49,171 --> 00:43:51,635
They always have mood swings.

542
00:43:51,635 --> 00:43:53,350
I never take it personally.

543
00:43:54,000 --> 00:43:55,440
I understand.

544
00:44:24,466 --> 00:44:27,200
Someone was selling these, so I bought them.

545
00:44:29,133 --> 00:44:30,413
Aren't they adorable?

546
00:44:31,000 --> 00:44:33,280
You should look at pictures
of cute babies often.

547
00:44:33,280 --> 00:44:35,577
Duean said it could make our baby turn out cute

548
00:44:35,577 --> 00:44:37,133
like the ones in the pictures.

549
00:44:38,880 --> 00:44:40,560
Don't buy them anymore.

550
00:44:41,177 --> 00:44:42,800
It's a waste of money.

551
00:44:42,800 --> 00:44:46,040
We should save money for food.
We don't have much.

552
00:45:03,644 --> 00:45:04,926
I'm uncomfortable.

553
00:45:08,355 --> 00:45:09,590
Okay...

554
00:45:17,495 --> 00:45:20,073
We shouldn't have registered our marriage.

555
00:45:21,860 --> 00:45:23,038
Why?

556
00:45:23,600 --> 00:45:26,180
You said you were okay with registering it

557
00:45:26,180 --> 00:45:28,022
so that the father couldn't walk away.

558
00:45:29,155 --> 00:45:31,440
I didn't think it through.

559
00:45:31,440 --> 00:45:33,996
The certificate is useless.

560
00:45:34,666 --> 00:45:38,422
Your mother would never let
any of her wealth fall into my hands.

561
00:45:39,080 --> 00:45:40,800
I'm the only one who loses.

562
00:45:49,980 --> 00:45:51,090
Just sleep.

563
00:45:51,777 --> 00:45:53,133
Our child's sleepy now.

564
00:46:15,960 --> 00:46:18,111
[Obstetrics and Gynecology Clinic]

565
00:46:21,080 --> 00:46:24,257
- Hello, Yai.
- Hello.

566
00:46:25,000 --> 00:46:26,666
How are you?

567
00:46:26,666 --> 00:46:28,240
Where's Ran?

568
00:46:29,200 --> 00:46:31,360
She's not home again. I asked her.

569
00:46:31,360 --> 00:46:33,560
She said she wanted to
have a look around the mall.

570
00:46:34,840 --> 00:46:36,431
Oh, okay.

571
00:46:39,360 --> 00:46:41,000
I'll pick it up.

572
00:46:45,320 --> 00:46:46,610
Hello.

573
00:46:49,160 --> 00:46:50,778
Ran?

574
00:46:50,778 --> 00:46:52,623
What's wrong? Where are you?

575
00:46:53,440 --> 00:46:54,674
What?

576
00:47:07,644 --> 00:47:10,488
[Obstetrics and Gynecology Clinic]

577
00:47:21,595 --> 00:47:23,849
I had an abortion.

578
00:47:31,942 --> 00:47:33,623
How am I supposed to think

579
00:47:33,623 --> 00:47:35,952
about my fiancé watching over
a security guard like this?

580
00:47:35,952 --> 00:47:38,480
Yai and I got engaged while we were in the US.

581
00:47:38,480 --> 00:47:42,240
If you're not too busy, come see me at home.

582
00:47:42,801 --> 00:47:45,600
Thank you, Uncle Yai. I'm going now.

583
00:47:47,400 --> 00:47:49,533
- Where's Daran?
- She resigned, sir.

584
00:47:49,533 --> 00:47:52,780
When you work with me...
Can I give you a little makeover?

585
00:47:52,780 --> 00:47:54,400
Approved.

586
00:47:54,400 --> 00:47:56,840
Lek, do you know where Daran is?

587
00:47:56,840 --> 00:47:58,145
I'm going to be serious now.
